    "created_at": "2020-06-30T22:19:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-30T22:19:15Z",
    "body": "For reference, it appears that all modern browsers will toggle the disabled checkbox, and issue an 'input' event, when a synthetic 'click' event is sent. My guess would be that the spec should be clarified to match existing browser behavior in this case.",
